{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 5861,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If your name is on a bank account with\nanyone else, a husband or a wife, an"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5861,
    "dDurationMs": 5021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "adult child, a brother or a sister, I need\nyou to hear this before you do one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10882,
    "dDurationMs": 4901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more thing. Because the very step that so\nmany good and careful people take"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15783,
    "dDurationMs": 4521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to protect themselves in their later\nyears, adding a trusted person to their"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20304,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bank account, is the same step that can\nquietly wipe out everything they have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24725,
    "dDurationMs": 3681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "spent a lifetime saving. Not because they\ndid anything wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28866,
    "dDurationMs": 2621,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not because the person they trusted is a\nbad person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31927,
    "dDurationMs": 4041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But because of the way a shared account\nworks under the law, in ways the bank"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35968,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will never once sit you down and explain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38348,
    "dDurationMs": 4801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am going to give you three reasons a\nshared bank account can go very wrong"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43149,
    "dDurationMs": 5342,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for someone over sixty five, in plain\nwords, with nothing dressed up and nothing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48491,
    "dDurationMs": 4881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "left out. And I want you to stay with me\nall the way to the third one, because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53372,
    "dDurationMs": 5281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it is the one that quietly tears families\napart, brother against sister, long"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58653,
    "dDurationMs": 4561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after a parent is gone, over money that\nwas never divided the way that parent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63214,
    "dDurationMs": 5201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wanted. Then, at the very end, I will show\nyou three safer ways to get the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68415,
    "dDurationMs": 3301,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "exact same help, with almost none of this\nrisk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72056,
    "dDurationMs": 5001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So as we go, keep a picture in your mind\nof every account you own, and whose"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77057,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "name is sitting on it beside yours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78997,
    "dDurationMs": 4481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, let me be clear about what we are\neven talking about, because the words"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83478,
    "dDurationMs": 1541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "matter more than you would think."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85619,
    "dDurationMs": 4201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A joint account is any bank account with\nmore than one name on it, where each"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89820,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "person is a full owner of all the money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92720,
    "dDurationMs": 1841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not a helper. Not an assistant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94921,
    "dDurationMs": 4721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A full owner, with the very same complete\nright to every dollar as you have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100142,
    "dDurationMs": 4341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And most people over sixty five who share\nan account did it for one simple,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104583,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "loving reason. So that someone could help\nthem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107764,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Help pay the bills if they land in the\nhospital."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110614,
    "dDurationMs": 3551,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Help manage things if their memory starts\nto slip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114755,
    "dDurationMs": 2671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Step in if something ever happens to them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118226,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It comes from the best place in the heart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121166,
    "dDurationMs": 5282,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But here is the hard truth. The moment you\nadd that second name as a joint"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126448,
    "dDurationMs": 6021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "owner, in the eyes of the bank and the\nlaw, that money is just as much theirs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132469,
    "dDurationMs": 5901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as it is yours. And that single fact is\nwhere all three of these dangers begin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138370,
    "dDurationMs": 5661,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first reason is this. Once someone is\na joint owner, they can take every"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144031,
    "dDurationMs": 5282,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dollar in that account, at any time, for\nany reason, and they never need to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149313,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ask your permission to do it. Not half of\nit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152033,
    "dDurationMs": 4501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of it. They can walk into the bank, or\ntap a few buttons on a phone, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156534,
    "dDurationMs": 4901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "move the entire balance into an account\nthat only they control, and there is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161435,
    "dDurationMs": 4181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nothing the bank is allowed to do to stop\nthem, because the law says the money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165616,
    "dDurationMs": 4321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is theirs too. Now, you may trust that\nperson with your whole heart, and you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169937,
    "dDurationMs": 4981,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "may be completely right to. But here is\nthe part that has nothing to do with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174918,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trust."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176278,
    "dDurationMs": 2661,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their troubles are now your troubles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179699,
    "dDurationMs": 4881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If that person is ever sued, the people\nsuing them can go after the money sitting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184580,
    "dDurationMs": 4961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in your account. If they run up a debt\nthey cannot pay, the company they owe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189541,
    "dDurationMs": 4821,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can reach in and take it. If they go\nthrough a divorce, their husband or wife"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194362,
    "dDurationMs": 5062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can try to claim part of it. And if that\nperson ever owes back taxes, the government"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199424,
    "dDurationMs": 4501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can freeze the account and pull the money\nout, right down to the last dollar,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204345,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even though every cent of it came from you\nand you alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207945,
    "dDurationMs": 2561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In some states they can take the entire\naccount."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211046,
    "dDurationMs": 4741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sit with that for a moment. Your life\nsavings, left wide open to a lawsuit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216247,
    "dDurationMs": 2861,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a divorce, or a tax bill that was never\nyours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219608,
    "dDurationMs": 3161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And none of this requires that anyone did\na single thing wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222769,
    "dDurationMs": 5721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A lawsuit after an ordinary car accident,\na small business that quietly fails,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229010,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a marriage that falls apart,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231471,
    "dDurationMs": 4681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "any one of these can reach into a joint\naccount through the other person, with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236152,
    "dDurationMs": 4681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no warning to you at all. The account does\nnot know whose money it was."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241273,
    "dDurationMs": 5061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It only sees two names, and the law treats\nevery dollar in it as fair game"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246334,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the troubles of either one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248914,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is why this has nothing to do with\nhow much you love or trust the person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254015,
    "dDurationMs": 4241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It has to do with everything life might\nthrow at them, and now at you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258456,
    "dDurationMs": 4281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second reason is one that almost\nnobody sees coming, and it is written"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262737,
    "dDurationMs": 3061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into the very bones of how a shared\naccount works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266318,
    "dDurationMs": 4281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most joint accounts come with something\nthe bank calls the right of survivorship."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270959,
    "dDurationMs": 1861,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In plain words, it means this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273240,
    "dDurationMs": 4161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The moment you pass away, whoever else is\non that account becomes the sole"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277401,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "owner of every dollar in it, instantly and\ncompletely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281221,
    "dDurationMs": 2041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here is the part that stuns families."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283742,
    "dDurationMs": 3821,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That rule beats your will. It does not\nmatter what your will says."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288103,
    "dDurationMs": 3861,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It does not matter if your will states, in\nblack and white, that everything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291964,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you own should be split evenly among all\nof your children."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295725,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The money in that joint account does not\nfollow your will at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299245,
    "dDurationMs": 4381,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It goes, entirely, to the one person whose\nname was sitting on the account."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303626,
    "dDurationMs": 4781,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me make this real, because it happens\nin ordinary, loving families every"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308407,
    "dDurationMs": 4581,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "single day. Picture a mother who adds her\noldest daughter to her checking account,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313368,
    "dDurationMs": 4281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for one reason only, so that daughter can\nhelp pay the bills as she gets older."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318309,
    "dDurationMs": 1541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Her will could not be clearer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320370,
    "dDurationMs": 3161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Split everything equally among all four of\nmy children."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324071,
    "dDurationMs": 4501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when that mother passes, the law hands\nthe whole account to the one daughter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328572,
    "dDurationMs": 4341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whose name was on it. The other three\nchildren are legally entitled to nothing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332913,
    "dDurationMs": 5001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from it. Now that one daughter holds all\nof it, and even in a close and loving"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337914,
    "dDurationMs": 3781,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "family, that is a heavy and cruel weight\nto lay on a person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342375,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The mother never meant to do any of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344455,
    "dDurationMs": 2741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She thought she was simply being organized\nand wise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347676,
    "dDurationMs": 4401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead, without ever knowing, she quietly\nwrote three of her children out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352077,
    "dDurationMs": 4141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a part of their inheritance, and lit a\nfire between them that may burn for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356218,
    "dDurationMs": 4161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the rest of their lives. The third reason\nstrikes at the very worst moment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360859,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the moment you need your money the most,\nand need help the most."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364440,
    "dDurationMs": 4721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the day ever comes that you need long\nterm care, a nursing home, or help"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369161,
    "dDurationMs": 4761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in your own home, a great many people turn\nto a program called Medicaid to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373922,
    "dDurationMs": 4341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "help pay for it, because that kind of care\ncan cost more than five thousand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378263,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dollars a month. But when you apply, that\nprogram looks very closely at your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382684,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bank accounts. And here is the trap."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385164,
    "dDurationMs": 4661,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If your name is on a joint account, the\nprogram can count the entire balance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389825,
    "dDurationMs": 4681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as yours, even the money the other person\nput in, and that can push you over"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394506,
    "dDurationMs": 3881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the limit and delay or deny the very help\nyou are desperate for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398527,
    "dDurationMs": 4481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Worse still, if you added that person\nwithin the last five years, it can be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403008,
    "dDurationMs": 4261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "treated as though you gave your money\naway, and you can be penalized for it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407269,
    "dDurationMs": 2881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and made to wait months before any help\nwill begin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410750,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there is one more quiet danger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412910,
    "dDurationMs": 5201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If that joint owner passes away before you\ndo, or falls into a legal fight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418111,
    "dDurationMs": 4901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of their own, the account can be frozen or\ntangled up at the exact moment you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423012,
    "dDurationMs": 1841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were counting on it to pay for your care."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425653,
    "dDurationMs": 4081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The very account you set up to make life\neasier can become the thing standing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429734,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between you and the help you need."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431654,
    "dDurationMs": 4101,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, I promised you this would not be only\na list of fears, and I meant it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435755,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because here is the good news."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437856,
    "dDurationMs": 4361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every single reason a person adds someone\nto their account, help with the bills,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442657,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "help if their memory fades, making sure\nthe right person receives the money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446377,
    "dDurationMs": 4741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the end, can all be handled in a safer\nway, without ever making another"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451118,
    "dDurationMs": 2721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "person a joint owner. Let me give you\nthree."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454259,
    "dDurationMs": 5501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first is called an authorized signer,\nsometimes called a convenience account."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460581,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This lets the person you trust write\nchecks and handle the account for you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465142,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and do all the day to day helping you\ncould ever need, but they are not an"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469362,
    "dDurationMs": 2681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "owner. Their debts cannot touch the money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472473,
    "dDurationMs": 1891,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It does not override your will."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474964,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It simply lets them help, and nothing\nmore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477624,
    "dDurationMs": 3081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second is called a payable on death\nbeneficiary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481225,
    "dDurationMs": 3101,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You simply tell the bank who should\nreceive the money when you are gone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484746,
    "dDurationMs": 4101,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Until that day comes, the money is\ncompletely yours, and yours alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489407,
    "dDurationMs": 4141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The person you named cannot touch a single\npenny while you are alive, and their"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493548,
    "dDurationMs": 4341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "troubles can never reach it. But the\nmoment you pass, the money goes straight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497889,
    "dDurationMs": 4611,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the person you chose, quickly and\nprivately, exactly as you wanted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502820,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The third, and the strongest, is a durable\npower of attorney."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506821,
    "dDurationMs": 4841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a legal paper, drawn up just once,\nthat names a person you trust to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511662,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "manage your money for you if the day ever\ncomes that you cannot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515783,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They must act for your benefit, never\ntheir own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518763,
    "dDurationMs": 2041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They never become an owner of your money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521084,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it protects you fully if your health\never fails."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524524,
    "dDurationMs": 4922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For a great many people, a payable on\ndeath beneficiary and a power of attorney"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529446,
    "dDurationMs": 4721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "together will do everything a joint\naccount was ever meant to do, with almost"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534167,
    "dDurationMs": 4761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "none of the danger. So here is the thread\nthat runs through all three of these."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539628,
    "dDurationMs": 5561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A joint account quietly hands away your\ncontrol, your protection, and your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545189,
    "dDurationMs": 5301,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "final wishes, all at once, and it does it\nin silence, until the day something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550490,
    "dDurationMs": 2781,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "goes wrong and it is far too late to undo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553831,
    "dDurationMs": 3321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you have time to check, right now,\ntoday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 557712,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This week, do three simple things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560252,
    "dDurationMs": 4841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, find out whose name is truly on\neach of your accounts, and whether the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 565093,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bank has you down as joint owners."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567754,
    "dDurationMs": 4761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Second, call your bank and ask about\nadding an authorized signer, and about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572515,
    "dDurationMs": 4901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "naming a payable on death beneficiary, and\ntell them plainly that you do not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577416,
    "dDurationMs": 5141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "want to add a joint owner. And third, if\nyour savings or your home are worth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582557,
    "dDurationMs": 4281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "protecting, sit down just once with a\nlawyer who works with older families,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587358,
    "dDurationMs": 2081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and set up a power of attorney the right\nway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589519,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And please do not let the words scare you\noff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592399,
    "dDurationMs": 2701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You do not need to understand every legal\nterm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595640,
    "dDurationMs": 4761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You only need to walk into your bank, or\npick up the phone, and say one simple"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600401,
    "dDurationMs": 5221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sentence. I want to help someone manage my\naccount, and I want the right person"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605622,
    "dDurationMs": 4721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to receive it when I am gone, but I do not\nwant to make anyone a joint owner."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611123,
    "dDurationMs": 4221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That one sentence points them to the safe\ntools, and it protects everything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615344,
    "dDurationMs": 4201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have built. This is general\ninformation to help you know what to ask about,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619785,
    "dDurationMs": 4181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it is not legal advice, because the\nexact rules are a little different"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623966,
    "dDurationMs": 4701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in every state. I have put where to start\nin the description just below this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628667,
    "dDurationMs": 4881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "video. And before you go, think of one\nperson who has quietly added a child,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633688,
    "dDurationMs": 4901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or a brother, or an old friend to their\nbank account, believing with all their"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 638589,
    "dDurationMs": 2241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "heart that they were being wise and safe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 641430,
    "dDurationMs": 4021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Send them this video. It could protect the\nsavings they worked a lifetime for,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645791,
    "dDurationMs": 3281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it could keep their family whole after\nthey are gone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649612,
    "dDurationMs": 5261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then go and check your own accounts this\nweek, and help someone you love check"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654873,
    "dDurationMs": 380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "theirs."
    } ]
  } ]
}
